==Battleground==
*15 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Medu-san]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns.
**3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Medu-san isn't that big of a deal here, and Aku Gory can be dealt with using [[Can Can Cat]] or [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]]. Le'Behemoth might be a bit of a problem, but if you're running Barrel you can Pierce Le'Behemoth's Shield and kill him quickly. Otherwise, brute force gets the job done, although not as quickly.

